<title>UK: Banca di Roma sets 300 bln lire 7-yr domestic FRN.</title>
<headline>Banca di Roma sets 300 bln lire 7-yr domestic FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers IMI Sigeco and Rasfin.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCA DI ROMA</p>
<p> AMT    300 BLN LIRE  SPREAD     +10 BP    MATURITY    01.NOV.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE   3MTH RIBOR    PAY DATE    31.OCT.96</p>
<p> ISSUE	PAR</p>
<p> LISTING    MILAN     DENOMS (M) 5	   GOV LAW    ITALIAN</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR, UNSECURED AND UNSUBORDINATED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
